## C5_1_Grade5NoPayment

C-5.1 removes the overtime payment for Grade 5 and substitutes TOIL.

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestC5_1_Grade5NoPayment:
  output r content Overtime.HourPremium

scope TestC5_1_Grade5NoPayment:
  definition r equals
    output of Overtime.HourPremium with {
      -- ordinal: 45
      -- grade: 5
      -- is_public_holiday: false
      -- is_critical_incident: false
      -- is_night: false
      -- has_standing_shift_allowance: false
    }
  assertion r.multiplier = 0.0
  assertion r.night_premium = 0.0
  assertion r.total_rate = 0.0
  assertion r.accrues_toil = true
```

## C5_1_Grade5Beyond48

C-5.1 defeats C-4.2 as well as C-4.1, being an exception to C-4 as a whole.

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestC5_1_Grade5Beyond48:
  output r content Overtime.HourPremium

scope TestC5_1_Grade5Beyond48:
  definition r equals
    output of Overtime.HourPremium with {
      -- ordinal: 50
      -- grade: 5
      -- is_public_holiday: false
      -- is_critical_incident: false
      -- is_night: false
      -- has_standing_shift_allowance: false
    }
  assertion r.multiplier = 0.0
  assertion r.night_premium = 0.0
  assertion r.total_rate = 0.0
  assertion r.accrues_toil = true
```

## C5_1_Grade4NotExempt

C-5.1 applies at 'Grade 5 or above', so Grade 4 keeps the C-4.1 rate.

```catala
