      -- has_standing_shift_allowance: false
    }
  assertion r.multiplier = 1.25
  assertion r.night_premium = 0.0
  assertion r.total_rate = 1.25
  assertion r.accrues_toil = false
```

## C5_2_CriticalIncident

C-5.2 reinstates the C-4 rate for Critical Incident Response.

