## C6_1_NightCumulative

C-6.1/C-8.2: the night premium is cumulative with the C-4.1 multiplier.

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestC6_1_NightCumulative:
  output r content Overtime.HourPremium

scope TestC6_1_NightCumulative:
  definition r equals
    output of Overtime.HourPremium with {
      -- ordinal: 45
      -- grade: 3
      -- is_public_holiday: false
      -- is_critical_incident: false
      -- is_night: true
      -- has_standing_shift_allowance: false
    }
  assertion r.multiplier = 1.25
  assertion r.night_premium = 0.15
  assertion r.total_rate = 1.4
  assertion r.accrues_toil = false
```

## C6_1_NightOnHoliday

C-8.2: cumulative with the substitutive holiday rate of C-7.

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestC6_1_NightOnHoliday:
  output r content Overtime.HourPremium

scope TestC6_1_NightOnHoliday:
  definition r equals
    output of Overtime.HourPremium with {
      -- ordinal: 45
      -- grade: 3
      -- is_public_holiday: true
      -- is_critical_incident: false
      -- is_night: true
      -- has_standing_shift_allowance: false
    }
  assertion r.multiplier = 2.0
  assertion r.night_premium = 0.15
  assertion r.total_rate = 2.15
  assertion r.accrues_toil = false
```

## C6_1_NightOnToilHour

C-6.1 confers the night premium on every Night Hour worked, including one that earns TOIL rather than pay.

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestC6_1_NightOnToilHour:
  output r content Overtime.HourPremium

scope TestC6_1_NightOnToilHour:
  definition r equals
    output of Overtime.HourPremium with {
      -- ordinal: 45
      -- grade: 5
      -- is_public_holiday: false
      -- is_critical_incident: false
      -- is_night: true
      -- has_standing_shift_allowance: false
    }
  assertion r.multiplier = 0.0
  assertion r.night_premium = 0.15
  assertion r.total_rate = 0.15
  assertion r.accrues_toil = true
```

## C6_2_StandingAllowance

C-6.2 disapplies the night premium where a standing shift allowance is paid.

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestC6_2_StandingAllowance:
  output r content Overtime.HourPremium

scope TestC6_2_StandingAllowance:
  definition r equals
    output of Overtime.HourPremium with {
      -- ordinal: 45
      -- grade: 3
      -- is_public_holiday: false
      -- is_critical_incident: false
      -- is_night: true
      -- has_standing_shift_allowance: true
    }
  assertion r.multiplier = 1.25
  assertion r.night_premium = 0.0
  assertion r.total_rate = 1.25
  assertion r.accrues_toil = false
```

## C6_1_NightOrdinaryHour

C-6.1 is not conditioned on overtime: an ordinary night hour still earns it.

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestC6_1_NightOrdinaryHour:
  output r content Overtime.HourPremium

scope TestC6_1_NightOrdinaryHour:
  definition r equals
    output of Overtime.HourPremium with {
      -- ordinal: 20
      -- grade: 3
      -- is_public_holiday: false
      -- is_critical_incident: false
      -- is_night: true
      -- has_standing_shift_allowance: false
    }
  assertion r.multiplier = 0.0
  assertion r.night_premium = 0.15
  assertion r.total_rate = 0.15
  assertion r.accrues_toil = false
```
